        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>吃住篇</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 28px 22px 40px 22px;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    font-family: -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 26px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .meta {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #6b6b6b;\n    margin-bottom: 34px;\n  }\n  .avatar {\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #0aa671;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 1px;\n    height: 15px;\n    background: #d8d8d8;\n    margin: 0 16px;\n  }\n  p.para {\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 34px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  h3 {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    margin: 22px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .caret {\n    display: inline-block;\n    color: #333;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    vertical-align: 3px;\n  }\n  .item {\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n    padding-left: 26px;\n  }\n  .hl {\n    background: #fdf07f;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .scrollbtn {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 6px;\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 34px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fff;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 34px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>吃住篇</h1>\n\n<div class=\"meta\">\n  <span class=\"avatar\">风少</span>\n  <span>风少</span>\n  <span class=\"divider\"></span>\n  <span>今天创建</span>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"para\">🏨吃住大家尽量以地铁站为中心，地铁站附近吃住都很方便，如爱联，吉祥，龙城广场，南联等，如果近的地铁站没有酒店了，就选远一点的，反正地铁都很方便</p>\n\n<p class=\"para\">⚠️下图有大运中心附近的所有地铁站</p>\n\n<p class=\"para\">酒店还没定的赶紧定，再晚就没了，深圳维也纳较多，实在没有酒店了场观附近还有几个水疗会所，也可以将就过夜</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"caret\">▼</span>龙岗商场</h2>\n\n<h3><span class=\"caret\">▼</span>星河cocopark</h3>\n<p class=\"item\">地铁：大运站12号口（14号线、16号线）</p>\n<p class=\"item\">美食：<span class=\"hl\">海底捞</span>、胖哥俩肉蟹煲、吴庄等</p>\n\n<h3><span class=\"caret\">▼</span>万科里</h3>\n<p class=\"item\">地铁：龙城广场D口（3号线）</p>\n<p class=\"item\">美食：街边铁桶烤肉、肉祭、八合里、原石牛扒</p>\n\n<h3><span class=\"caret\">▼</span>仁恒梦广场</h3>\n<p class=\"item\">地铁：愉园C口（16号线）</p>\n<p class=\"item\">美食：79号渔船、文和友、渝月、</p>\n\n<h3><span class=\"caret\">▼</span>万科广场</h3>\n<p class=\"item\">地铁：吉祥站C口（3号线）</p>\n<p class=\"item\">美食：SHADOW觅、西贝、凑凑火锅、蔡澜港式点心</p>\n\n<h3><span class=\"caret\">▼</span>摩尔城</h3>\n<p class=\"item\">地铁：南联B2口（3号线）</p>\n<p class=\"item\">美食：老碗会、萨莉亚、小龙坎火锅</p>\n\n<h3><span class=\"caret\">▼</span>天玑城</h3>\n<p class=\"item\">地铁：南联B2口（3号线）</p>\n<p class=\"item\">美食：<span class=\"hl\">海底捞</span>、九毛九、大弗兰</p>\n\n<h3><span class=\"caret\">▼</span>龙岗天光城</h3>\n<p class=\"item\">地铁：爱联站D口（3号线）</p>\n<p class=\"item\">美食：悦得闲、先启半步颠小酒馆、农耕记</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
